  "method": "Replay every observation from the seeded match through persistent QuickJS workers, serially, using unchanged manifest limits. Pair master then research and repeat twice before and after the Depths optimization. Noop policy measures observation decoding/QuickJS JSON parse plus empty output validation; full includes policy work/output. Values are worker wall ms; noop subtraction is an estimate, not an instrumented phase measurement. On timeout reload the measured policy and record the error, so subsequent full-policy state differs in failed runs. Fixture trajectory is independently generated by the original policy in Node VM. Both optimized research runs checked identical Depths intent JSON versus the original at every decision. Raw per-seat/per-tick byte counts and timings are in /tmp/ac-research/*-{before,after}-{1,2}.json.",
